1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:01,538
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:03,020
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:05,793
- General?
- Yeah.

4
00:00:05,818 --> 00:00:07,523
Getting the picture now?

5
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,417
Yeong Ju, you're home?

6
00:00:28,012 --> 00:00:30,975
Who is this woman?

7
00:00:35,598 --> 00:00:38,328
That damn woman?

8
00:00:38,916 --> 00:00:39,967
Il Dong.

9
00:00:40,141 --> 00:00:41,141
Well...

10
00:00:41,714 --> 00:00:42,714
Hey.

11
00:00:42,775 --> 00:00:46,032
Are you two living here together?

12
00:00:46,205 --> 00:00:48,170
What on earth is going on here?

13
00:00:48,656 --> 00:00:50,428
Yeong Ju, what do I do?

14
00:00:51,198 --> 00:00:52,475
Hey!

15
00:00:53,259 --> 00:00:55,518
I've got you now.

16
00:00:58,656 --> 00:01:00,874
- Uncle!
- Let go!

17
00:01:00,899 --> 00:01:01,959
Stop right there!

18
00:01:02,878 --> 00:01:04,723
Seung Woo!

19
00:01:04,908 --> 00:01:05,983
Seung Woo, are you okay?

20
00:01:10,118 --> 00:01:11,555
Seriously, that bitch!

21
00:01:15,318 --> 00:01:17,418
- Why is it so noisy?
- Seung Hyun!

22
00:01:17,443 --> 00:01:21,316
- Grab your uncle! Hurry!
- What's going on?

23
00:01:22,994 --> 00:01:24,076
Are you okay?

24
00:02:09,752 --> 00:02:11,792
Yeong Ju!

25
00:02:11,817 --> 00:02:13,878
What am I going to do?

26
00:02:13,902 --> 00:02:15,552
- Where were you?
- What?

27
00:02:15,577 --> 00:02:17,737
I crouched down and hid
in front of someone else's house!

28
00:02:17,762 --> 00:02:20,005
Like they say,
"It's right under his nose!"

29
00:02:20,567 --> 00:02:21,571
Good thinking.

30
00:02:21,792 --> 00:02:23,939
You're quite the clever one.

31
00:02:24,134 --> 00:02:25,652
What am I going to do now?

32
00:02:25,685 --> 00:02:27,114
He'll be back!

33
00:02:27,798 --> 00:02:29,125
What should I do?

34
00:02:30,132 --> 00:02:33,894
- Hide in the storage room for now.
- "The storage room?"

35
00:02:34,401 --> 00:02:37,191
- It's scary in there.
- Seriously!

36
00:02:37,655 --> 00:02:38,830
Seriously!

37
00:02:38,855 --> 00:02:39,989
Okay.

38
00:02:49,825 --> 00:02:51,240
Are you really okay?

39
00:02:52,309 --> 00:02:53,309
I'm okay.

40
00:02:53,696 --> 00:02:54,696
What about Uncle?

41
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:56,399
He'll come back after wandering around.

42
00:02:56,770 --> 00:02:58,865
I hope Seung Hyun sent him home.

43
00:03:00,178 --> 00:03:03,035
What about that woman?

44
00:03:03,558 --> 00:03:05,792
I told her to hide
in the storage room for now.

45
00:03:06,665 --> 00:03:10,125
If Il Dong comes and searches the place,
keep him from causing trouble.

46
00:03:10,379 --> 00:03:11,379
I'm tired.

47
00:03:12,405 --> 00:03:13,707
Yes.

48
00:03:17,678 --> 00:03:20,376
Yeong Ju's changing.

49
00:03:56,179 --> 00:03:58,521
Where on earth did she disappear to?

50
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,278
Uncle!

51
00:04:19,633 --> 00:04:21,032
That's enough.

52
00:04:22,109 --> 00:04:23,299
Go home.

53
00:04:25,398 --> 00:04:27,316
She sure ran off like a rat.

54
00:04:31,178 --> 00:04:33,839
You're a man. Why are you so winded
from just running a little?

55
00:04:34,809 --> 00:04:35,809
I know.

56
00:04:37,352 --> 00:04:38,352
Are you sick or something?

57
00:04:40,772 --> 00:04:42,313
Hey, go home.

58
00:04:42,743 --> 00:04:43,743
Okay.

59
00:04:44,398 --> 00:04:47,908
I followed you
because I feared you'd make another scene.

60
00:04:48,914 --> 00:04:49,914
Now go home.

61
00:04:51,891 --> 00:04:54,938
But how can you live with that woman?

62
00:04:54,992 --> 00:04:56,409
Is your mom out of her mind?

63
00:04:56,572 --> 00:04:57,895
And what did you two do?
You should've stopped her.

64
00:04:57,919 --> 00:04:59,069
I told you.

65
00:04:59,852 --> 00:05:00,968
Her daughter...

66
00:05:02,153 --> 00:05:03,323
saved O Reum.

67
00:05:03,348 --> 00:05:04,477
Even so...

68
00:05:08,211 --> 00:05:09,668
Anyway, keep your mom in check.

69
00:05:09,963 --> 00:05:11,473
She absolutely can't remarry, got it?

70
00:05:11,498 --> 00:05:14,252
She should've thrown the papers at them
and started over as I told her.

71
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,598
Why is she making a scene now?

72
00:05:17,152 --> 00:05:18,230
Exactly.

73
00:05:18,344 --> 00:05:20,443
Anyway, your mom is so damn stubborn.

74
00:05:22,417 --> 00:05:23,417
I'm leaving.

75
00:05:23,732 --> 00:05:26,282
If I go in there now,
I'll just cause a scene as you said.

76
00:05:26,892 --> 00:05:29,093
Tell her I'm letting it go just for today.

77
00:05:29,632 --> 00:05:30,632
Okay.

78
00:05:31,130 --> 00:05:32,130
Take care.

79
00:05:39,652 --> 00:05:42,163
- Still nothing?
- I followed Sa Bin's car after dinner,

80
00:05:42,187 --> 00:05:43,651
but I lost it in heavy traffic.

81
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:45,695
I'm sorry. I'll look into it again.

82
00:05:46,413 --> 00:05:49,052
Okay. We'll catch him soon. You can go.

83
00:05:49,077 --> 00:05:51,012
Thank you for understanding.

84
00:05:58,792 --> 00:05:59,792
Honey!

85
00:06:03,062 --> 00:06:05,520
Where did you buy this dress?

86
00:06:05,544 --> 00:06:06,544
Do you like it?

87
00:06:07,004 --> 00:06:09,727
What got into you?
You picked out a great dress.

88
00:06:09,745 --> 00:06:11,903
Living with you must've improved my taste.

89
00:06:13,302 --> 00:06:16,315
- Thanks.
- I'm glad you like it.

90
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:17,979
- Come over when you're done.
- Okay.

91
00:06:26,123 --> 00:06:27,464
How about this dress?

92
00:06:42,645 --> 00:06:43,645
Joong Bin.

93
00:06:43,938 --> 00:06:47,091
I'm here.

94
00:06:48,317 --> 00:06:49,438
Hey, Sa Bin.

95
00:06:49,924 --> 00:06:51,455
What?

96
00:06:52,738 --> 00:06:53,814
You're seeing someone?

97
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,212
So it's true.

98
00:06:57,692 --> 00:06:59,767
- You even went to Nam San together?
- How'd you know?

99
00:06:59,792 --> 00:07:00,903
I was going to tell you anyway.

100
00:07:00,928 --> 00:07:02,865
Sun Kyung saw you. Who is she?

101
00:07:03,869 --> 00:07:05,202
A woman.

102
00:07:05,321 --> 00:07:08,462
Come on. Don't joke around. I'm serious.

103
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:11,514
A good woman.

104
00:07:11,972 --> 00:07:14,896
The woman who broke 50 years of silence.

105
00:07:16,285 --> 00:07:20,683
I'll announce it soon.
The big reveal is coming, so be patient.

106
00:07:20,707 --> 00:07:21,757
Wait.

107
00:07:22,412 --> 00:07:23,767
It's not that musician, right?

108
00:07:23,792 --> 00:07:25,619
- The one who recently became a widow?
- No.

109
00:07:26,632 --> 00:07:27,632
Okay, then.

110
00:07:28,409 --> 00:07:30,409
Is she still young enough
to have children?

111
00:07:30,705 --> 00:07:31,705
Curious?

112
00:07:31,905 --> 00:07:32,905
If you are,

113
00:07:33,223 --> 00:07:34,881
you'll have to wait.

114
00:07:38,356 --> 00:07:39,356
That boy.

115
00:07:53,099 --> 00:07:54,777
You know, I think...

116
00:07:55,205 --> 00:07:56,637
Sa Bin really is seeing someone.

117
00:07:57,312 --> 00:08:00,203
Don't worry about your brother.
He's 50. Look at this.

118
00:08:01,198 --> 00:08:02,198
What's this?

119
00:08:02,563 --> 00:08:04,267
That's Ji Hu and Ji Ni.

120
00:08:04,292 --> 00:08:05,625
Looks like she's
working part-time at this cafe.

121
00:08:07,016 --> 00:08:08,518
This is a hangover soup place.

122
00:08:08,592 --> 00:08:09,592
And this...

123
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,863
is your company lounge.

124
00:08:12,165 --> 00:08:14,971
He's off with that Ji Ni or whatever,

125
00:08:14,995 --> 00:08:16,926
rubbing his magic lamp.

126
00:08:21,152 --> 00:08:22,347
Why?

127
00:08:23,047 --> 00:08:25,847
- I'm going to see Ji Hu.
- Wait.

128
00:08:25,872 --> 00:08:28,760
- We need a plan.
- What plan?

129
00:08:28,785 --> 00:08:30,535
We need to nip this in the bud.

130
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,963
Didn't you see him yesterday?

131
00:08:32,397 --> 00:08:35,389
I think it's already too late
to nip this in the bud.

132
00:08:39,025 --> 00:08:40,188
Then what do we do?

133
00:08:41,005 --> 00:08:43,179
That's what I'm trying to figure out.

134
00:08:43,532 --> 00:08:45,827
I've seen her mom. The mistress.

135
00:08:46,072 --> 00:08:47,501
She's no ordinary woman.

136
00:08:48,111 --> 00:08:50,521
Like mother, like daughter.

137
00:08:50,985 --> 00:08:52,229
What should I do?

138
00:08:57,245 --> 00:08:58,469
It's Ambassador Do.

139
00:08:59,091 --> 00:09:00,536
At this hour?

140
00:09:01,124 --> 00:09:03,232
It's afternoon over there.

141
00:09:05,945 --> 00:09:08,357
Yes, Ambassador. Hello.
What's the occasion?

142
00:09:08,831 --> 00:09:10,239
I know.

143
00:09:10,659 --> 00:09:12,352
They're kids. They'll fight.

144
00:09:13,191 --> 00:09:16,004
We're trying not to interfere too much
and make things worse.

145
00:09:16,731 --> 00:09:18,972
Yes. I'm sorry for worrying you.

146
00:09:23,321 --> 00:09:26,048
It's not like we're
marrying off a princess to him.

147
00:09:26,802 --> 00:09:28,869
Seriously!

148
00:09:29,010 --> 00:09:32,279
Why did you retire early
and put us in this situation?

149
00:09:32,312 --> 00:09:36,047
I wish you had a higher rank
and could hold your head up.

150
00:09:38,612 --> 00:09:39,612
Let's get some sleep.

151
00:10:01,463 --> 00:10:02,902
(4:29 a.m.)

152
00:10:12,397 --> 00:10:14,854
Seung Woo.

153
00:10:16,691 --> 00:10:17,691
Yeah.

154
00:10:19,112 --> 00:10:20,315
Why are you sleeping out here?

155
00:10:20,802 --> 00:10:22,693
- Go to your room.
- Seung Hyun.

156
00:10:23,129 --> 00:10:24,539
Are you feeling better?

157
00:10:30,546 --> 00:10:31,853
Your fever's gone down.

158
00:10:31,878 --> 00:10:34,264
You were really sick last night.

159
00:10:34,412 --> 00:10:36,309
- You were talking nonsense.
- I was?

160
00:10:36,865 --> 00:10:37,962
What did I say?

161
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:40,404
Seung Woo, I love you.

162
00:10:40,752 --> 00:10:41,932
You're all I have.

163
00:10:43,945 --> 00:10:45,926
- That's crazy.
- Anyway,

164
00:10:45,950 --> 00:10:47,528
I'm glad your fever's gone down.

165
00:10:47,552 --> 00:10:48,552
Want something?

166
00:10:48,719 --> 00:10:49,719
Aren't you hungry?

167
00:10:57,152 --> 00:10:59,036
Mom got a marriage proposal yesterday.

168
00:11:00,992 --> 00:11:02,018
How many times will you say that?

169
00:11:02,351 --> 00:11:03,607
You think I'd forget having a fever?

170
00:11:03,632 --> 00:11:04,865
But that doctor...

171
00:11:05,312 --> 00:11:07,553
is the younger brother
of the general our uncle serves.

172
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:09,039
What?

173
00:11:10,465 --> 00:11:11,999
So that's why Uncle came?

174
00:11:12,592 --> 00:11:14,629
I thought he came because of that woman.

175
00:11:15,479 --> 00:11:17,105
How did things get this complicated?

176
00:11:17,130 --> 00:11:18,948
What are we going to do...

177
00:11:19,122 --> 00:11:21,158
- with Yeong Ju?
- Do what?

178
00:11:21,183 --> 00:11:22,551
If it's not the right path,
she shouldn't take it.

179
00:11:23,552 --> 00:11:25,326
Do you really not want her to remarry?

180
00:11:26,387 --> 00:11:27,387
Are you okay with it?

181
00:11:28,298 --> 00:11:30,276
I don't feel one way or the other.

182
00:11:31,098 --> 00:11:32,719
Grandma and grandpa are gone,

183
00:11:32,904 --> 00:11:34,600
and we're all grown up.

184
00:11:34,625 --> 00:11:37,969
I don't think there's anything wrong
with her starting a new life as a woman.

185
00:11:38,531 --> 00:11:41,703
As a woman, she was lonely and unhappy.

186
00:11:43,055 --> 00:11:44,387
"Starting a new life..."

187
00:11:45,487 --> 00:11:46,719
I don't know.

188
00:11:46,972 --> 00:11:48,754
I don't know what that even means anymore.

189
00:11:49,652 --> 00:11:52,151
I used to think of her as just mom...

190
00:11:52,289 --> 00:11:54,577
and "Mom's a woman?
What does that even mean?"

191
00:11:55,432 --> 00:11:58,260
But I saw her smiling with him.

192
00:11:58,752 --> 00:11:59,752
It was nice.

193
00:12:00,632 --> 00:12:02,868
I didn't know she could smile like that.

194
00:12:03,252 --> 00:12:05,076
She was always sighing and snapping at us.

195
00:12:05,791 --> 00:12:08,011
Honestly, it was hard on us too.

196
00:12:08,345 --> 00:12:11,080
That's why I'd come home every day
dancing and singing.

197
00:12:11,104 --> 00:12:12,576
Putting on a whole show.

198
00:12:12,929 --> 00:12:13,929
Forget it.

199
00:12:14,432 --> 00:12:15,804
I don't know what to think.

200
00:12:17,268 --> 00:12:18,568
But what was that girl thinking,

201
00:12:18,593 --> 00:12:21,374
helping mom with her proposal?
Who does she think she is?

202
00:12:22,278 --> 00:12:25,213
She wants mom to be happy.

203
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:26,714
She knows what her birth...

204
00:12:27,093 --> 00:12:29,982
meant to us. It was like a bomb going off.

205
00:12:30,644 --> 00:12:34,768
I had nothing else to say,
so I picked out a few photos for her.

206
00:12:35,014 --> 00:12:36,229
Forget it.

207
00:12:36,692 --> 00:12:37,906
I don't like any of them.

208
00:12:50,798 --> 00:12:52,470
When does filming start?

209
00:12:52,614 --> 00:12:54,372
Next week.

210
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,685
I need to lose weight
and buy some clothes.

211
00:12:57,098 --> 00:12:59,246
I'm glad I got my makeup license.

212
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:00,358
Yeah.

213
00:13:00,898 --> 00:13:02,317
You'll look the prettiest.

214
00:13:02,342 --> 00:13:05,761
Hey, they'll all be coming
from fancy salons.

215
00:13:06,009 --> 00:13:08,470
- Don't you know who's coming?
- No.

216
00:13:08,495 --> 00:13:09,975
I find out when they first check in.

217
00:13:11,262 --> 00:13:13,629
I can't wait. I'm so excited.

218
00:13:14,688 --> 00:13:16,693
Me too. I wonder who's coming.

219
00:13:16,952 --> 00:13:19,595
What if I'm the only one no one chooses?

220
00:13:19,860 --> 00:13:20,860
That'd be so embarrassing.

221
00:13:21,819 --> 00:13:23,824
You have your own charm.

222
00:13:24,591 --> 00:13:26,930
If I were a guy, I'd pick you.

223
00:13:26,947 --> 00:13:27,947
Really?

224
00:13:28,066 --> 00:13:30,558
- I'll hold you to that.
- I'm serious.

225
00:13:31,445 --> 00:13:33,128
Can't we vote by phone?

226
00:13:33,153 --> 00:13:35,012
We should ask
all our old classmates to vote.

227
00:13:36,185 --> 00:13:38,096
Why would there be voting
on a dating show?

228
00:13:38,409 --> 00:13:41,311
You really don't know anything
besides painting.

229
00:13:41,998 --> 00:13:44,504
Still, I'm kind of touched by you.

230
00:13:44,529 --> 00:13:45,838
Why are you being so proactive?

231
00:13:48,325 --> 00:13:50,196
Good morning, girls.

232
00:13:51,169 --> 00:13:54,617
- Ma'am, it's been a while.
- Jung A!

233
00:13:57,677 --> 00:13:58,830
You could take after her.

234
00:13:58,855 --> 00:14:01,385
My only daughter treats her own mom
like a stranger...

235
00:14:01,409 --> 00:14:03,159
and always lectures me.

236
00:14:03,183 --> 00:14:05,552
Why are you picking a fight?
Loading the missiles?

237
00:14:05,576 --> 00:14:06,925
How scary.

238
00:14:08,345 --> 00:14:10,586
I came because I was worried
my only daughter might starve,

239
00:14:10,611 --> 00:14:12,661
so I brought you some spending money.

240
00:14:13,265 --> 00:14:15,002
You left this morning
without even saying goodbye.

241
00:14:15,117 --> 00:14:16,597
Mom.

242
00:14:17,005 --> 00:14:19,529
I'm only "Mom" when you need something.

243
00:14:19,637 --> 00:14:21,303
Buy Jung A something good to eat too.

244
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:24,139
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

245
00:14:24,545 --> 00:14:27,169
I heard you're going on a dating show.

246
00:14:27,699 --> 00:14:32,047
You're so cheerful, you even get on shows
like that. You've grown up well.

247
00:14:32,072 --> 00:14:34,563
Your mom must be so proud of you.

248
00:14:34,771 --> 00:14:37,172
I think I know how Kongjwi must've felt
compared to Patjwi.

249
00:14:38,758 --> 00:14:41,405
You should be the one going on TV, not me.

250
00:14:41,518 --> 00:14:43,545
- You look even prettier today.
- What?

251
00:14:44,725 --> 00:14:46,358
And you even speak so sweetly.

252
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,496
Two iced Americanos, please.

253
00:14:49,977 --> 00:14:51,478
Use the kiosk.

254
00:14:52,712 --> 00:14:54,326
Ma'am, I'll do it for you.

255
00:14:54,887 --> 00:14:56,107
- Okay. Thanks.
- Sure.

256
00:15:02,976 --> 00:15:04,772
I'll turn it slightly this way.

257
00:15:09,878 --> 00:15:11,562
Why is this taking so long?

258
00:15:11,978 --> 00:15:14,525
I'm in trouble.
I haven't been practicing enough.

259
00:15:15,338 --> 00:15:16,825
What kind of part-time job do you have?

260
00:15:16,972 --> 00:15:18,445
Don't you use your hands too much?

261
00:15:18,447 --> 00:15:22,292
What job doesn't require your hands?
Unless you're a runner.

262
00:15:23,651 --> 00:15:26,351
Then let's try a different treatment.

263
00:15:26,352 --> 00:15:27,352
Okay.

264
00:15:28,158 --> 00:15:30,310
I heard you proposed to her.

265
00:15:31,709 --> 00:15:32,709
Yeah.

266
00:15:33,163 --> 00:15:34,180
What did she say?

267
00:15:36,371 --> 00:15:38,651
She keeps misunderstanding me
whenever I say something.

268
00:15:39,118 --> 00:15:40,908
I think she thinks I'm jealous.

269
00:15:41,502 --> 00:15:42,910
No, jealous? Why would she think that?

270
00:15:42,912 --> 00:15:44,625
Yeong Ju isn't the type to think that.

271
00:15:45,152 --> 00:15:46,903
She's probably just feeling guilty.

272
00:15:47,831 --> 00:15:50,378
It's only been a short while
since your husband passed away.

273
00:15:51,752 --> 00:15:52,906
That's a good interpretation.

274
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:54,185
What do her sons say?

275
00:15:54,296 --> 00:15:56,391
It's not just her sons.

276
00:15:56,980 --> 00:15:58,645
Why? Is something going on?

277
00:15:59,605 --> 00:16:02,722
It's a little awkward for me
to tell you everything,

278
00:16:02,823 --> 00:16:04,718
but she said she'd contact you.

279
00:16:05,432 --> 00:16:07,338
Just wait a little longer.

280
00:16:07,398 --> 00:16:10,093
Our lovestruck bachelor doctor.

281
00:16:11,354 --> 00:16:12,466
I'm curious.

282
00:16:20,318 --> 00:16:21,318
Yeong Ju?

283
00:16:21,770 --> 00:16:23,635
Yes, she wants to see me tonight.

284
00:17:00,745 --> 00:17:01,745
Mother.

285
00:17:07,572 --> 00:17:10,089
Mom, how did you put up with this
all these years?

286
00:17:10,158 --> 00:17:12,140
Why did you suppress
your desire to date someone?

287
00:17:12,172 --> 00:17:13,293
You little brat.

288
00:17:13,372 --> 00:17:15,723
I'm struggling too. I'm hurting too.

289
00:17:15,725 --> 00:17:18,296
Couldn't you at least stay by Mai's side
and look after her for a while?

290
00:17:18,612 --> 00:17:21,330
If you'd just stayed home,
you could've stopped her from leaving.

291
00:17:22,492 --> 00:17:24,098
I'm really hurt by you, Mom.

292
00:17:24,910 --> 00:17:26,031
I'm really disappointed.

293
00:17:26,871 --> 00:17:29,118
He's the younger brother
of the General I serve.

294
00:17:29,158 --> 00:17:30,715
Turn him down firmly...

295
00:17:30,810 --> 00:17:32,552
and help him come to his senses.

296
00:17:32,651 --> 00:17:35,926
If you start spouting that nonsense
about love again like before,

297
00:17:36,243 --> 00:17:38,106
I swear I'll make you regret it this time.

298
00:17:40,105 --> 00:17:41,210
You bastard.

299
00:17:52,272 --> 00:17:53,272
What did you say?

300
00:17:53,535 --> 00:17:56,143
As for the artist Lee Ye Eun
we were going to sign,

301
00:17:56,425 --> 00:17:58,115
they told us to replace her
with someone else.

302
00:17:58,152 --> 00:18:01,665
It came from upper management.
Didn't you get the message, sir?

303
00:18:01,667 --> 00:18:03,191
No, I didn't.

304
00:18:04,007 --> 00:18:05,064
Just proceed.

305
00:18:05,378 --> 00:18:07,932
Lee Ye Eun is key to this project.
We can't drop her.

306
00:18:07,998 --> 00:18:11,192
But it came from upper management.
There's not much we can do.

307
00:18:12,052 --> 00:18:13,503
I'll go speak to the CEO.

308
00:18:24,011 --> 00:18:25,038
What are we supposed to do?

309
00:18:25,487 --> 00:18:28,133
- You're going out again?
- What can I do? I'm busy.

310
00:18:28,665 --> 00:18:30,042
This job requires my skill,

311
00:18:30,043 --> 00:18:32,311
and other places need my looks.
What can I do?

312
00:18:37,678 --> 00:18:38,957
Ms. Do.

313
00:18:39,806 --> 00:18:41,543
I got my father-in-law's permission too.

314
00:18:41,544 --> 00:18:43,083
I got his permission too.

315
00:18:43,085 --> 00:18:45,239
I got approval to publish this book too.

316
00:18:45,241 --> 00:18:46,438
I'll work from home.

317
00:18:46,618 --> 00:18:48,411
I can use my talent from home.

318
00:18:49,205 --> 00:18:52,263
But I have to go in person
to put my looks to use.

319
00:18:52,776 --> 00:18:53,776
Okay?

320
00:18:54,798 --> 00:18:56,595
You said you're too busy
showing off your looks everywhere,

321
00:18:56,597 --> 00:18:58,232
so when are you planning to draw?

322
00:18:58,573 --> 00:18:59,891
Who's going to draw for you?

323
00:19:01,653 --> 00:19:02,751
What are you saying?

324
00:19:03,705 --> 00:19:06,225
Are you saying
I'm using a ghost artist now?

325
00:19:06,425 --> 00:19:08,265
Are you going to keep talking
to me like that?

326
00:19:08,267 --> 00:19:11,434
Even if you sit and draw all day,
you don't have enough time, so...

327
00:19:11,949 --> 00:19:13,568
that's why I said it.

328
00:19:14,573 --> 00:19:15,788
Okay. I'm sorry.

329
00:19:16,326 --> 00:19:17,326
You can go.

330
00:19:21,917 --> 00:19:23,754
She's the only one who's busy.

331
00:19:24,765 --> 00:19:26,351
Ji Ni,

332
00:19:26,771 --> 00:19:28,331
I really miss you.

333
00:19:42,497 --> 00:19:43,818
Welcome.

334
00:19:45,978 --> 00:19:46,978
Ma'am?

335
00:19:47,694 --> 00:19:48,694
Jung A.

336
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:52,814
You came to buy clothes?

337
00:19:53,589 --> 00:19:55,460
Yes. Someone recommended this place.

338
00:19:55,745 --> 00:19:58,279
Why are you here? Don't you have lessons?

339
00:19:59,838 --> 00:20:01,211
I'll tell you later.

340
00:20:01,923 --> 00:20:03,498
Take a look. I'll give you a discount.

341
00:20:04,085 --> 00:20:07,637
But keep this a secret
from Ji Ni for a while.

342
00:20:11,138 --> 00:20:14,356
How about this? These sell well
among young people lately.

343
00:20:15,385 --> 00:20:17,599
What's your concept on the show?

344
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,040
This one.

345
00:20:20,465 --> 00:20:21,751
You'd look pretty in this too.

346
00:20:23,018 --> 00:20:24,456
This one's really popular lately.

347
00:20:25,070 --> 00:20:26,070
Yeah.

348
00:20:28,792 --> 00:20:29,792
Really?

349
00:20:30,333 --> 00:20:32,370
She's your older sister?

350
00:20:33,569 --> 00:20:34,569
Yes.

351
00:20:36,598 --> 00:20:37,736
What a coincidence...

352
00:20:39,624 --> 00:20:41,745
She's not the kind of woman
you would ever like.

353
00:20:41,852 --> 00:20:43,412
Yes, she can sing well.

354
00:20:43,525 --> 00:20:46,704
But you shouldn't date her
just to cure your tone-deafness.

355
00:20:47,085 --> 00:20:49,538
The general has high expectations for you.

356
00:20:52,905 --> 00:20:55,038
- You haven't told my brother yet, right?
- I can't.

357
00:20:55,111 --> 00:20:56,657
How could I tell him something like this?

358
00:20:58,569 --> 00:20:59,598
Give it up.

359
00:21:00,332 --> 00:21:03,162
I'll make sure my sister gets over you.

360
00:21:03,164 --> 00:21:04,869
No, don't.

361
00:21:04,871 --> 00:21:07,809
Who are you to tell her to get over me?

362
00:21:08,392 --> 00:21:11,231
- This is between her and me.
- Doctor.

363
00:21:13,225 --> 00:21:15,877
Anyway, I understand what you mean.

364
00:21:17,465 --> 00:21:18,917
I'm asking you, please.

365
00:21:20,158 --> 00:21:21,392
I absolutely cannot...

366
00:21:21,855 --> 00:21:24,052
cause the general any more trouble.

367
00:21:25,138 --> 00:21:26,838
Please consider my position too.

368
00:21:42,138 --> 00:21:44,013
I can't believe
Lieutenant No is your younger brother.

369
00:21:44,409 --> 00:21:45,506
I was really surprised.

370
00:21:45,854 --> 00:21:46,926
Me too.

371
00:21:48,716 --> 00:21:51,163
- We really...
- A perfect match.

372
00:21:52,612 --> 00:21:55,004
How did it take us this long to meet?

373
00:21:56,792 --> 00:21:58,572
Do you really think so?

374
00:21:59,962 --> 00:22:00,962
Of course.

375
00:22:02,925 --> 00:22:05,311
Don't force yourself to think positively.

376
00:22:06,205 --> 00:22:08,865
It just means we're not meant to be.

377
00:22:10,118 --> 00:22:11,648
Thanks to you, Sa Bin,

378
00:22:12,632 --> 00:22:14,727
I realized I'm still a woman.

379
00:22:18,171 --> 00:22:20,570
I can't even remember the last time...

380
00:22:21,088 --> 00:22:22,525
my heart raced like this.

381
00:22:23,931 --> 00:22:25,482
When I was going to see you,

382
00:22:26,204 --> 00:22:28,408
I pulled out clothes I never wear,

383
00:22:29,633 --> 00:22:31,447
but they smelled musty.

384
00:22:32,917 --> 00:22:34,317
That's right.

385
00:22:34,872 --> 00:22:36,836
This is the kind of woman I am.

386
00:22:37,535 --> 00:22:38,625
I'm the same.

387
00:22:39,571 --> 00:22:41,664
My life wasn't glamorous.

388
00:22:42,825 --> 00:22:45,043
I spent my days steeped in the smell
of herbal medicine.

389
00:22:45,698 --> 00:22:48,320
When you opened a singing class
in our building,

390
00:22:49,587 --> 00:22:51,212
light came into my life.

391
00:22:53,211 --> 00:22:55,051
I felt like a breeze had started blowing.

392
00:22:55,904 --> 00:22:56,986
Thank you.

393
00:22:57,718 --> 00:22:58,857
I'll never forget...

394
00:23:00,212 --> 00:23:01,858
this excitement.

395
00:23:04,065 --> 00:23:05,337
Now that you...

396
00:23:06,315 --> 00:23:08,416
know what love feels like,

397
00:23:09,765 --> 00:23:10,933
from now on,

398
00:23:11,717 --> 00:23:13,698
you'll know how to recognize a good love.

399
00:23:17,478 --> 00:23:18,753
Yeong Ju.

400
00:23:21,005 --> 00:23:22,190
Going any further...

401
00:23:23,671 --> 00:23:25,404
will only hurt us.

402
00:23:26,585 --> 00:23:29,219
Both us and our families.

403
00:24:12,805 --> 00:24:13,870
Where are you going?

404
00:24:14,910 --> 00:24:16,030
To find Mai.

405
00:24:16,655 --> 00:24:17,678
At this hour?

406
00:24:17,745 --> 00:24:19,735
Clubs are just getting started.

407
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:21,716
That's right.

408
00:24:23,437 --> 00:24:24,747
Go ahead.

409
00:24:25,677 --> 00:24:28,093
Look everywhere.

410
00:24:29,612 --> 00:24:31,653
Tell her I'm waiting at home.

411
00:24:31,899 --> 00:24:34,202
Make sure you tell her, okay?

412
00:24:35,807 --> 00:24:36,807
Okay.

413
00:24:57,378 --> 00:24:58,681
What are you doing?

414
00:25:04,065 --> 00:25:05,291
Drinking alone?

415
00:25:07,772 --> 00:25:09,272
Who else would I be drinking with?

416
00:25:19,172 --> 00:25:20,672
Looks like it's going to rain again.

417
00:25:21,458 --> 00:25:23,245
The weather's been
so unpredictable lately.

418
00:25:23,905 --> 00:25:25,539
It's been like Southeast Asia for ages.

419
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,739
What's it to you?

420
00:25:30,486 --> 00:25:32,165
You're right. What's it to me?

421
00:25:40,531 --> 00:25:42,885
"Life isn't lonely."

422
00:25:45,251 --> 00:25:48,491
"It's merely commonplace,
like a magazine cover."

423
00:25:50,892 --> 00:25:53,458
"What is it that we're afraid
of regretting..."

424
00:25:56,445 --> 00:25:58,529
"that makes us leave?"

425
00:26:00,469 --> 00:26:01,589
Yeong Ju.

426
00:26:05,718 --> 00:26:06,772
Yeong Ju.

427
00:26:07,214 --> 00:26:08,447
Who was I to...

428
00:26:10,175 --> 00:26:12,413
think I could dream
of something like that?

429
00:26:14,698 --> 00:26:17,097
There's no way
happiness would ever come to me.

430
00:26:20,625 --> 00:26:21,797
Yeong Ju.

431
00:26:30,912 --> 00:26:32,099
Yeong Ju.

432
00:26:32,747 --> 00:26:35,396
Let's hang in there.

433
00:26:36,823 --> 00:26:37,857
Yeah.

434
00:26:38,308 --> 00:26:39,474
Love shot?

435
00:27:10,192 --> 00:27:11,605
She's Lieutenant No's older sister.

436
00:27:12,424 --> 00:27:14,664
She has two sons, and she's a grandmother.

437
00:27:16,072 --> 00:27:17,818
Her grandson passed away recently.

438
00:27:18,712 --> 00:27:19,804
Before that,

439
00:27:20,594 --> 00:27:21,895
a long time ago,

440
00:27:22,573 --> 00:27:24,523
her husband abandoned her too.

441
00:27:25,478 --> 00:27:27,027
What else do you want to know?

442
00:27:29,351 --> 00:27:31,108
Don't dig into her background anymore.

443
00:27:31,191 --> 00:27:33,189
Sa Bin.

444
00:27:34,358 --> 00:27:36,045
You're going to marry that woman?

445
00:27:36,132 --> 00:27:37,518
She rejected me.

446
00:27:40,085 --> 00:27:42,129
But I haven't given up.

447
00:27:42,751 --> 00:27:45,927
So don't pressure me and don't interfere.

448
00:27:46,041 --> 00:27:47,145
Just wait.

449
00:27:48,385 --> 00:27:49,757
As for that woman,

450
00:27:50,020 --> 00:27:53,005
whether I give up or wait for her,
I'll decide that myself!

451
00:28:12,628 --> 00:28:15,875
(Family Register)

452
00:28:15,898 --> 00:28:17,118
I guess you're ashamed.

453
00:28:17,120 --> 00:28:19,978
You think I don't know that trick
of pulling back to reel them in?

454
00:28:19,980 --> 00:28:22,052
It seems Yeong Ju has completely given up.

455
00:28:22,053 --> 00:28:23,490
Sa Bin, you should give up too.

456
00:28:23,492 --> 00:28:24,978
Why is your second brother so handsome?

457
00:28:24,980 --> 00:28:26,376
He's insanely handsome up close.

458
00:28:26,378 --> 00:28:28,885
I could lose you to any woman but Ji Ni.

459
00:28:28,887 --> 00:28:30,383
I couldn't care less about your love.

460
00:28:30,385 --> 00:28:32,012
Ji Hu is Ji Hu. I'm me.

461
00:28:32,014 --> 00:28:33,634
There's nothing you can do to me anymore.

462
00:28:33,636 --> 00:28:35,725
So this is it, right?
You're moving on to someone else?

463
00:28:37,098 --> 00:28:39,098
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
